      "snippet": "History and Class Consciousness: Studies in Marxist Dialectics.Georg Luk\u00e1cs - 1971 - MIT Press. Georg Luka\u0301cs: from romanticism to Bolshevism.Michael L\u00f6wy - 2023 - New York: Verso.",
